("Leave the discontinued capsules off your routine unless the treating doctor explicitly restarts them.", ["negation"]),
("The printed list and the bottle disagree on frequency; have a pharmacist resolve this before the next dose.", ["conflict"]),
("Obtain enough of your regular tablets to cover the coming week.", ["refill"]),
("Continue the ointment and discontinue the drops, as written in the prescription.", ["multiple_actions"]),
("If the medicine makes swallowing difficult, ask your dispensing team for advice.", ["conditional"]),
("Your prescriber has changed the quantity per dose; use the revised label.", ["routine"]),
("Do not double your tablets after forgetting a dose; follow the supplied medication advice.", ["negation"]),
("Have the community pharmacist compare your pre-admission drugs with the discharge chart.", ["reconciliation"]),
("Use the oral solution with the supplied dose-measuring device.", ["routine"]),
],
"safety": [
("If you suddenly cannot speak clearly or move an arm, call for emergency assistance.", ["conditional"]),
("A swollen throat or rapidly worsening breathing is a reason to obtain emergency help at once.", ["routine"]),
("Do not postpone seeking immediate care if you pass out or become very hard to rouse.", ["negation"]),
("The routine appointment is next week; go to urgent care today if the incision becomes increasingly red and you have a fever.", ["multiple_actions"]),
("Seek emergency assessment for a large ongoing loss of blood, regardless of the old instruction to wait.", ["conflict"]),
("Ask for urgent medical help if your child is too drowsy to drink.", ["conditional"]),
("Get immediate professional help when a sudden severe headache occurs with a stiff neck.", ["routine"]),
("If you are at immediate risk of injuring yourself, contact emergency support now.", ["conditional"]),
("Keep taking the medicine as directed, and obtain emergency help for serious breathing difficulty.", ["multiple_actions"]),
("A leg that suddenly becomes painfully cold needs immediate medical attention.", ["routine"]),
],
"context": [
