      "image": "walkthrough/intake.png",
      "layout": "portrait",
      "crop": [
        315,
        24,
        810,
        952
      ],
      "crop_reason": "native dialog bounds",
      "keyline": "The original notes\nstart the plan."
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 4,
      "title": "04 / Review the whole source",
      "image": "walkthrough/sentence-review.png"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 5,
      "title": "05 / Unclear details stay visible",
      "image": "walkthrough/source-review.png",
      "layout": "portrait",
      "crop": [
        830,
        0,
        610,
        1000
      ],
      "crop_reason": "native dialog bounds",
      "keyline": "No date in the source?\nKeep the question open."
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 6,
      "title": "06 / A named tracker for the next step",
      "image": "walkthrough/confirmed-followup.png",
      "layout": "portrait",
      "crop": [
        830,
        0,
        610,
        1000
      ],
      "crop_reason": "native dialog bounds",
      "keyline": "Maya tracks the task.\nThat does not assign\nclinical responsibility."
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 7,
      "start_sentence": 0,
      "end_sentence": 4,
      "title": "07 / Receipt and review stay separate",
      "image": "walkthrough/result-received.png",
      "layout": "portrait",
      "crop": [
        830,
        0,
        610,
        1000
      ],
      "crop_reason": "native dialog bounds",
      "keyline": "Result received.\nClinician review pending."
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 7,
      "start_sentence": 4,
      "title": "08 / Record the reported ending",
      "image": "walkthrough/reported-closure.png",
      "layout": "portrait",
      "crop": [
        830,
        0,
        610,
        1000
      ],
      "crop_reason": "native dialog bounds",
      "keyline": "A recorded ending.\nA user report."
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 8,
      "title": "09 / A plan people can take with them",
      "image": "walkthrough/visit-brief.png",
      "layout": "portrait",
      "crop": [
        315,
        24,
        810,
        952
      ],
      "crop_reason": "native dialog bounds",
      "keyline": "Bring the next steps\nto the next visit."
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 9,
      "title": "10 / A business hypothesis to test",
      "card": "$149 per month\nfor 100 care episodes",
      "card_note": "First buyer: a primary-care or transitions coordinator.\nOne coordinator account. Pricing remains a hypothesis."
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 10,
      "title": "11 / A small model with visible limits",
      "card": "82% raw accuracy\n44 of 50 abstentions",
      "card_note": "50 separate synthetic challenge examples.\nClinical validation remains outstanding."
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 11,
      "title": "12 / A supervised pilot comes next",
      "image": "walkthrough/reported-closure.png",
      "layout": "portrait",
      "crop": [
